     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Menus and Dutch food",
     "texto": [
      "On a Dutch menu («menukaart»), main dishes and starters are usually combined with adjectives or complements: «tomatensoep» (tomato soup), «broodje kaas» (cheese sandwich, where «broodje» is the diminutive of bread), «groene salade» (green salad). In the drinks section («dranken») you find the most common drinks, such as coffee, tea and water."
     ],
